{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-eden-hills-villas","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"eden-hills-villas","about":"Discover the epitome of luxury living at Eden Hills, H&amp;H Development's latest masterpiece in Dubai's real estate market: Eden Hills Villas is Nestled in the elite MBR City and offers a unique chance to own a piece of this prestigious area. The project features an exclusive collection of 350 5-6 bedroom villas and plots, part of a meticulously planned community right beside the renowned Dubai Hills Estate. Eden Hills by H&amp;H is more than a development; it's a lifestyle.The community is divided into distinct clusters, each with its own charm: Country Woodlands: a haven of tranquility offering a serene rural setting with lush parks, expansive green spaces, and charming farm-style architecture; Agrarian Ranch: perfect for those who dream of rural bliss, including agricultural plots, vibrant orchards, and beautifully maintained lawns; and Shady Canyon: designed for adventure lovers, featuring natural canyons, extensive biking paths, and invigorating hiking trails. With Eden Hills Villas and Eden Hills Plots, experience luxury villa development redefined in the heart of Dubai.","price":18000000,"title":"Eden Hills Villas","bitrix":{"id":293,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Eden Hills","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Eden Hills","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"H&H Development","project_location":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/eden_hills_feature_a2706ff2bc.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/eden_hills_feature_a2706ff2bc.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1613526,"lng":55.2769123},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/eden_hills_1_794ebe26b0.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudf